  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">About our brand and products:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(18,18,18);font-family:Arial, Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:pre-line;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">We are a mid-range outdoor furniture brand under the COUTURE group, with over 17 years of manufacturing and Imp&amp;Exp trading experience. The brand adheres to a customer-centric approach and a win-win philosophy, continuously innovating to provide innovative and cost-effective outdoor furniture products to partners worldwide.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">What makes us different:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We focus on <strong>one core product</strong> that is simple, visual, and easy to promote.</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Clean, modern design that fits well in social media content</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Affordable price point compared to high-end outdoor furniture</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Designed specifically for lifestyle and outdoor creators</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Strong demand in the US backyard &amp; pool market</li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>How affiliates can earn: </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Affiliates earn commission for every successful order generated through their unique link.</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Average commission: $20–$30 per sale</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">No cap on earnings</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Performance-based (the more you sell, the more you earn)</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">This program is ideal for creators who prefer <strong>consistent, realistic earnings</strong> over one-time deals.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">How to promote us: </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">You can promote our product through content that fits your style.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Popular formats include:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">TikTok / Instagram Reels</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Backyard &amp; pool lifestyle videos</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">“Summer setup” or aesthetic content</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Product showcase or UGC-style videos</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We provide product images and materials to help you get started quickly.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br>Other information: </span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">No inventory or upfront cost required</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">No need to purchase the product</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Open to US-based creators and affiliates</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\">Fast application review (typically within 24–48 hours)</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">👉 Apply through the link to get started.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">https://af.uppromote.com/8bd153-25/register?p=181277</span></p></div></div></div>",
